# Canonical "keyword-only text" pattern (coverage ratchet + fidelity inventory).
# Text made exclusively of keywords / parenthesised modifiers has no ability content.
# Bounded [^()]* instead of .*? so the alternation cannot backtrack catastrophically.
# Flags: IGNORE_CASE (applied by both consumers).
^((?:alpha|omega|elusive|skirmish|taunt|hazardous\s*\d*|assault\s*\d*|deploy|poison|splash-attack\s*\d*|\([^()]*\))[\s.,]*)*$
